  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0200_73a9fff852ca.png\" style=\"width: 336px; height: 79px;\" /></p><p>The output of the first NAND gate</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math></p><p>The output of the second NAND gate</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mover><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mover><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>So, the equivalent circuit will be an AND gate.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p>"
  }
